  "description": "Hwiyeon has spent countless years cultivating his skills and accumulating virtue with a single goal: to ascend as a dragon and become a god. But becoming a god requires recognition; only an intelligent being can truly acknowledge Hwiyeon, a wyvern, as divine.\n\nThen…  \n*“Wow, what a beautiful snake.”*\n\nA single remark from Kang-ah, the young heir of the family that has served Hwiyeon for centuries, shatters everything he has built like smoke in the wind.\n\nEnraged, Hwiyeon refrains from slaughtering everyone and instead decides to take Kang-ah away from the family, hoping to earn the chance to be called a god once more.\n\nYet, as they spend time together, Hwiyeon’s initial hatred slowly fades. Over time, he begins to feel an inexplicable sense of déjà vu toward Kang-ah, now grown into adulthood.\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/dragonS2)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nJapanese: [Beltoon](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/dragons2), [Lezhin](https://lezhin.jp/comic/dragons2), [cmoa](https://www.cmoa.jp/title/343004/), [Renta](https://renta.papy.co.jp/renta/sc/frm/item/422643)",
